WEBVTT

00:00:01.288 --> 00:00:10.356
<i>GRENADIER</i>

00:00:10.597 --> 00:00:20.097
<i>Carving my footsteps
in the amber colored road...</i>

00:00:20.207 --> 00:00:29.912
<i>... I've finally come this far.
I keep my eyes on the road ahead.</i>

00:00:30.184 --> 00:00:39.320
<i>Only time moves faster than me...</i>

00:00:39.726 --> 00:00:49.863
<i>... I look back, and
the road behind me shines blue.</i>

00:00:50.871 --> 00:00:56.832
<i>The flames of all the lives
I've encountered...</i>

00:00:57.044 --> 00:01:00.445
<i>I wish I could hold them in my arms.</i>

00:01:00.614 --> 00:01:06.280
<i>So that we don't get swept away
by this great river...</i>

00:01:06.420 --> 00:01:09.947
<i>... I want our hearts to be one.</i>

00:01:10.123 --> 00:01:19.122
<i>We're all travelers, after all.</i>

00:01:37.551 --> 00:01:41.282
<i>Final Episode
Things Learned on the Road</i>

00:01:45.325 --> 00:01:48.692
So, what are you going to do, boys?

00:01:50.764 --> 00:01:53.892
Or do you want to play at
Miss Touka's pleasure palace?

00:01:54.001 --> 00:01:54.763
Mikan...

00:01:54.868 --> 00:01:58.497
If you act now, I'll give you
some gift certificates.

00:02:00.641 --> 00:02:05.977
They aren't just ordinary gift certificates!
They are for three nights and four days!

00:02:06.113 --> 00:02:07.705
Three nights, four days!

00:02:07.848 --> 00:02:09.440
First come first served!

00:02:18.592 --> 00:02:21.152
My ultimate fighting strategy.

00:02:21.295 --> 00:02:23.729
You've grown up, Mikan.

00:02:31.238 --> 00:02:33.365
How far do we have to climb?

00:02:33.473 --> 00:02:34.940
Just a little more...

00:02:35.142 --> 00:02:35.904
Huh!

00:02:37.210 --> 00:02:38.370
Tenshi!

00:02:47.754 --> 00:02:49.483
You can't go further.

00:02:49.623 --> 00:02:52.057
Damn it, I'll take care of him.

00:02:52.192 --> 00:02:54.319
You go find Tenshi!

00:02:54.428 --> 00:02:54.985
Yes!

00:02:55.128 --> 00:02:57.858
Doshi! I will strip you of your armor!

00:02:57.998 --> 00:02:59.158
Unlikely!

00:03:08.275 --> 00:03:09.207
Yatchan!

00:03:09.743 --> 00:03:11.836
Yatchan, are you okay?

00:03:11.978 --> 00:03:13.445
Go! Rushuna!

00:03:14.281 --> 00:03:15.145
Okay.

00:03:17.918 --> 00:03:19.408
You fool.

00:03:19.553 --> 00:03:22.044
Enough fooling around!

00:03:22.189 --> 00:03:23.281
Doshi...

00:03:23.757 --> 00:03:27.352
You taught me the path of the
swordsman...

00:03:27.527 --> 00:03:29.222
Draw your sword!

00:03:29.396 --> 00:03:31.626
Silly nonsense!

00:03:31.865 --> 00:03:34.595
I can kill you with one shot.

00:03:34.735 --> 00:03:37.966
How superficial! Human life...

00:03:38.071 --> 00:03:41.768
You told me to feel the weight
of human life with my hands.

00:03:41.875 --> 00:03:43.843
Were those empty words?

00:03:43.944 --> 00:03:47.345
Is the Jester's mask to
hide your true feelings?

00:03:47.481 --> 00:03:52.919
If I felt the weight of human life
each time I killed, I'd become...

00:03:53.086 --> 00:03:54.154
...a monster.

00:03:54.154 --> 00:03:55.519
<i>That's right.
...a monster.</i>

00:03:55.655 --> 00:04:00.285
So what could be better than killing with
a smile! That's what this mask is for.

00:04:00.427 --> 00:04:01.325
What?

00:04:02.028 --> 00:04:06.294
Anyone who gets in the way of
my rise to power is worthless.

00:04:06.666 --> 00:04:10.329
Yajiro, you have become one of them.

00:04:12.739 --> 00:04:14.934
Erasing the will to fight?

00:04:15.075 --> 00:04:17.737
That's the ultimate fighting strategy?

00:04:17.878 --> 00:04:19.607
Don't make me laugh!

00:04:20.180 --> 00:04:24.310
One by one, little by
little, times are changing?

00:04:24.518 --> 00:04:28.545
You are deluded by
Tenshi's childish notions!

00:04:28.889 --> 00:04:33.588
Now, in these war torn times,
many people are crying!

00:04:33.693 --> 00:04:36.821
They must be unified at once!

00:04:38.064 --> 00:04:40.532
What about your rhetoric?

00:04:40.634 --> 00:04:44.536
There's nothing good about
a world ruled by force!

00:04:45.238 --> 00:04:48.332
You're not after world unification!

00:04:48.508 --> 00:04:50.339
You're after power!

00:04:50.510 --> 00:04:54.810
You tried to use Rushuna and
you even used the Juttensen.

00:04:54.948 --> 00:04:57.883
All for your own ambitions!

00:04:58.018 --> 00:05:00.578
Is that all you have to say?

00:05:00.687 --> 00:05:04.020
Those will be your last words!

00:05:09.663 --> 00:05:11.824
Damn fools!

00:05:13.233 --> 00:05:14.632
Touka Kurenai!

00:05:16.336 --> 00:05:20.602
Yajiro's not alone in
his line of thinking.

00:05:21.675 --> 00:05:25.304
Stay out of this, Touka.
I'm going to fight him.

00:05:25.745 --> 00:05:28.475
He used to be a friend of mine.

00:05:28.615 --> 00:05:29.707
I see.

00:05:29.883 --> 00:05:32.511
Let's see what you can do.

00:05:32.652 --> 00:05:33.710
Sorry.

00:05:36.523 --> 00:05:39.651
Then come alone, Yajiro!

00:05:46.600 --> 00:05:50.036
They're not going to do it here?

00:06:02.582 --> 00:06:05.813
Tenshi, are you okay? Are you hurt?

00:06:05.952 --> 00:06:09.319
Rushuna! I'm fine.

00:06:10.023 --> 00:06:11.081
Tenshi.

00:06:11.525 --> 00:06:14.517
Things have gotten out of control.

00:06:14.694 --> 00:06:17.458
What about the person
who had a gun on you?

00:06:17.564 --> 00:06:22.831
She must have thought there was no
longer any point. She left me and ran off.

00:06:25.505 --> 00:06:29.407
Rushuna, why do you have
that look in your eyes?

00:06:29.576 --> 00:06:33.535
Erasing the will to fight is
the ultimate battle strategy.

00:06:33.647 --> 00:06:36.741
Put that ugly thing away.

00:06:38.084 --> 00:06:41.451
You think I'm Setsuna, don't you?

00:06:41.555 --> 00:06:42.351
Yes.

00:06:42.489 --> 00:06:44.650
You're so honest.

00:06:44.858 --> 00:06:48.487
What can I do to make you
believe I'm the real one?

00:06:48.628 --> 00:06:51.893
Ms. Setsuna, stop the charade.

00:06:52.032 --> 00:06:52.862
Rushuna?

00:06:52.999 --> 00:06:55.433
You're not Tenshi.

00:06:55.735 --> 00:06:59.034
That's very inappropriate,
even coming from you.

00:06:59.205 --> 00:07:02.936
I'm sorry, but I can tell.

00:07:03.076 --> 00:07:05.946
Do you plan to shoot me with that gun?

00:07:05.946 --> 00:07:06.742
<i>No.
Do you plan to shoot me with that gun?</i>

00:07:06.846 --> 00:07:09.337
I just want you to give up.

00:07:09.549 --> 00:07:13.041
No matter how hard you try,
you can never be Tenshi.

00:07:13.820 --> 00:07:15.879
I am Tenshi.

00:07:18.558 --> 00:07:20.617
Enough! Shoot her!

00:07:23.663 --> 00:07:24.595
Tenshi!

00:07:24.698 --> 00:07:25.630
You!

00:07:26.933 --> 00:07:27.763
Tenshi!

00:07:28.668 --> 00:07:32.001
One move, and Tenshi's life is over.

00:07:32.772 --> 00:07:35.468
Give it up, Rushuna!

00:07:36.042 --> 00:07:37.407
Rushuna!

00:07:39.112 --> 00:07:42.946
I won't miss this time.
I'm going to fill you with holes!

00:07:49.789 --> 00:07:54.385
Once you've been wrapped in my
armored cloth, you'll never get away.

00:07:56.930 --> 00:07:58.295
Rushuna...

00:07:58.698 --> 00:08:00.791
I'll take care of her.

00:08:00.900 --> 00:08:01.889
Teppa!

00:08:02.068 --> 00:08:03.763
Teppa Aizen!

00:08:03.903 --> 00:08:06.736
Please, Setsuna, give up.

00:08:06.873 --> 00:08:12.243
I threw away that name on the day
I decided to become that woman!

00:08:12.779 --> 00:08:15.339
Impossible. You're not the same!

00:08:15.482 --> 00:08:16.540
How so!

00:08:16.683 --> 00:08:18.947
Well, um, er...

00:08:19.285 --> 00:08:22.311
Your chest is too big to be Tenshi's.

00:08:23.456 --> 00:08:29.656
No, it's what is hidden in your bosom
that's proof you aren't Tenshi.

00:08:30.363 --> 00:08:31.796
I see.

00:08:32.332 --> 00:08:34.061
You mean this?

00:08:34.200 --> 00:08:35.030
Yes.

00:08:35.301 --> 00:08:39.738
...that and your ambition.
I want to strip you of it all.

00:08:40.340 --> 00:08:41.500
Interesting.

00:08:44.778 --> 00:08:47.679
Do you think you can
strip me of my ambition...

00:08:47.781 --> 00:08:50.750
...with this ultimate
fighting strategy of yours?

00:08:54.287 --> 00:08:56.118
Follow me, Rushuna!

00:08:56.322 --> 00:08:58.813
Teppa, take care of Tenshi.

00:08:58.958 --> 00:09:00.721
Leave it to me.

00:09:01.895 --> 00:09:04.989
So it's come down to
the two of them fighting.

00:09:05.131 --> 00:09:06.800
We should leave it to Rushuna.

00:09:06.800 --> 00:09:07.960
<i>You're right.
We should leave it to Rushuna.</i>

00:09:08.068 --> 00:09:11.196
I have no choice but
to believe in Rushuna.

00:09:11.371 --> 00:09:18.174
Both of them were chosen to be my
doubles from the Juttensen candidates.

00:09:22.782 --> 00:09:24.079
Ouch.

00:09:35.528 --> 00:09:39.487
Their innate instincts
and their reflexes...

00:09:39.666 --> 00:09:45.070
They received identical training
and both became excellent marksmen.

00:09:47.907 --> 00:09:51.707
That's right, their strengths
are evenly matched.

00:09:54.080 --> 00:09:54.944
Yes.

00:09:55.315 --> 00:09:58.250
Their strengths are evenly matched...

00:09:58.485 --> 00:10:01.818
But what Rushuna gained
during her travels...

00:10:02.021 --> 00:10:05.457
...is not something
that Setsuna possesses.

00:10:06.459 --> 00:10:09.792
It's like I'm fighting against myself.

00:10:10.930 --> 00:10:12.397
Ms. Setsuna...

00:10:20.740 --> 00:10:21.764
So...

00:10:22.375 --> 00:10:25.742
I can't move on unless I kill you.

00:10:42.295 --> 00:10:47.198
I will feel the weight of your life
with my own two hands!

00:10:49.669 --> 00:10:50.693
Doshi!

00:10:51.271 --> 00:10:52.738
Here goes!

00:10:58.311 --> 00:10:59.300
You!

00:11:00.847 --> 00:11:05.807
Tiger of the Rear Guard! The more
trapped he is, the stronger he becomes.

00:11:05.952 --> 00:11:07.579
He's grown.

00:11:13.560 --> 00:11:16.154
You still have a lot to learn, Yajiro!

00:11:20.200 --> 00:11:21.098
Ms. Setsuna...

00:11:21.201 --> 00:11:23.362
I'm not interested in talking.

00:11:23.503 --> 00:11:25.630
Let me ask just one thing.

00:11:25.972 --> 00:11:29.169
Why are you doing this?

00:11:29.309 --> 00:11:31.243
Let me ask you something...

00:11:31.344 --> 00:11:35.041
Was it your choice to
become Tenshi's double?

00:11:35.181 --> 00:11:37.411
Don't you want to be yourself?

00:11:37.550 --> 00:11:41.213
Who would ever want to live
as someone else's double?

00:11:41.788 --> 00:11:45.884
I thought that Tenshi's
philosophy was beautiful.

00:11:46.059 --> 00:11:48.619
That's what made me choose this path.

00:11:48.795 --> 00:11:51.855
Living by other people's ideas is foolish!

00:11:52.332 --> 00:11:56.769
One day, I discovered
that I could rule the world.

00:11:57.003 --> 00:12:00.564
So I'm going to control the world myself!

00:12:00.740 --> 00:12:05.040
One day... you mean when
you met Kaizan Doshi?

00:12:05.778 --> 00:12:08.338
Then it's not your own idea!

00:12:08.481 --> 00:12:09.379
Shut up!

00:12:09.549 --> 00:12:11.210
What does it matter?

00:12:11.384 --> 00:12:16.185
We aren't all alone in the world.
You can follow other people's ideas.

00:12:16.389 --> 00:12:19.950
Getting people to see your point
of view... that's your trick!

00:12:20.059 --> 00:12:22.254
I'm not going to fall for it.

00:12:48.354 --> 00:12:52.688
You do know, Rushuna, that
I have one bullet left...

00:12:53.226 --> 00:12:55.421
...and you have none.

00:13:16.149 --> 00:13:18.413
You dirty bastard!

00:13:18.584 --> 00:13:22.179
Dirty because I use skills you don't have?

00:13:22.422 --> 00:13:28.383
Did you expect me to fight fair
because we were once on the same side?

00:13:28.928 --> 00:13:32.762
You can't rule the world
with such naive ideas!

00:13:33.933 --> 00:13:35.025
Yajiro!

00:13:35.435 --> 00:13:37.528
The game ends here!

00:13:39.439 --> 00:13:40.428
What?

00:13:47.580 --> 00:13:49.912
Why didn't you shoot me?

00:13:50.717 --> 00:13:54.050
I know what I have that you don't.

00:13:54.921 --> 00:13:59.324
I'm prepared to kill you,
and to kill Tenshi too!

00:14:01.828 --> 00:14:04.262
It was great, Rushuna.

00:14:04.497 --> 00:14:08.763
We received the same training as
doubles. It's a shame to kill you.

00:14:08.901 --> 00:14:13.838
But this is where it ends.
I will rule the world in Tenshi's place.

00:14:14.574 --> 00:14:15.836
This is it.

00:14:16.009 --> 00:14:18.136
There's no way you can win.

00:14:18.244 --> 00:14:20.007
That's not true.

00:14:20.146 --> 00:14:22.341
What are you saying?

00:14:22.482 --> 00:14:27.579
The ultimate fighting strategy is
to erase the enemy's will to fight.

00:14:32.225 --> 00:14:33.453
It's over.

00:14:34.060 --> 00:14:36.187
You lose, Doshi.

00:14:36.362 --> 00:14:37.454
Silence!

00:14:40.199 --> 00:14:42.394
You know, don't you, Doshi?

00:14:42.635 --> 00:14:45.934
My sword skills are superior to yours!

00:14:46.506 --> 00:14:47.973
Not yet.

00:14:48.107 --> 00:14:50.268
I still have not lost.

00:14:50.410 --> 00:14:54.141
Why? Why won't you give up?

00:14:55.982 --> 00:14:58.177
A sword...

00:15:00.953 --> 00:15:03.979
You must be unarmored...

00:15:07.427 --> 00:15:09.292
What are you doing?

00:15:10.830 --> 00:15:13.196
What are you doing, Yajiro?

00:15:13.332 --> 00:15:16.563
This isn't that idiotic
fighting strategy, is it?

00:15:17.336 --> 00:15:20.931
...and hold them close to your bosom!

00:15:22.975 --> 00:15:24.738
What are you doing!

00:15:32.351 --> 00:15:35.616
This is how I hug!

00:15:49.702 --> 00:15:50.930
Yajiro.

00:15:52.738 --> 00:15:54.433
Do... shi...

00:15:55.708 --> 00:15:59.041
Why... why did you do that?

00:15:59.512 --> 00:16:04.381
I wanted to strip you of
your armor no matter what...

00:16:05.418 --> 00:16:09.479
...with the weight of my life.

00:16:10.556 --> 00:16:12.524
You felt it, didn't you?

00:16:12.658 --> 00:16:14.182
My weight?

00:16:29.041 --> 00:16:33.808
You still don't get it? You're a peon who
has nothing to depend on but force!

00:16:42.922 --> 00:16:43.820
Yajiro!

00:16:44.223 --> 00:16:45.053
Yajiro!

00:16:45.191 --> 00:16:48.160
Hang in there! Don't die, Yajiro!

00:16:53.499 --> 00:16:56.696
I win, don't I?

00:16:59.805 --> 00:17:03.502
Rushuna, why did I lose to you?

00:17:04.710 --> 00:17:07.838
I wonder...

00:17:08.114 --> 00:17:13.142
I'm sure you'll understand
if you travel the world.

00:17:14.487 --> 00:17:16.387
Travel...

00:17:22.562 --> 00:17:24.086
Hey, you!

00:17:27.667 --> 00:17:28.725
Rushuna!

00:17:29.602 --> 00:17:30.864
Setsuna...

00:17:33.439 --> 00:17:34.565
I lose.

00:17:35.374 --> 00:17:36.841
I lose.

00:17:37.276 --> 00:17:41.679
I lost to the other you...
I lost to my other self.

00:17:53.993 --> 00:17:58.657
It's a medicated bath.
It's the best thing to heal wounds.

00:17:59.832 --> 00:18:03.233
Make sure you get in all the way
up to your shoulders.

00:18:03.369 --> 00:18:06.497
Hmm? Koto?

00:18:07.073 --> 00:18:09.803
I survived because of you.

00:18:11.711 --> 00:18:14.737
Allow me to wash your back.

00:18:16.282 --> 00:18:17.977
Y-Yes...

00:18:18.985 --> 00:18:21.317
T-Tenshi?

00:18:22.655 --> 00:18:26.318
Oh... Yatchan, it's me!

00:18:26.459 --> 00:18:30.953
Oh, it's you. Don't scare me like that.

00:18:31.163 --> 00:18:32.960
I'm not good enough?

00:18:33.099 --> 00:18:36.068
No, it's not that you're not good enough...

00:18:36.235 --> 00:18:39.102
Yatchan, how's your head wound?

00:18:39.372 --> 00:18:42.899
Huh? I'm fine, it's nothing...

00:18:44.277 --> 00:18:47.144
Yatchan, thank you.

00:18:47.313 --> 00:18:50.339
I'm so glad you're with me.

00:18:53.486 --> 00:18:56.546
Yajiro's an interesting
character, isn't he?

00:18:56.656 --> 00:18:59.056
Do you think so too, Tenshi?

00:18:59.158 --> 00:19:02.150
He's such a pervert, I don't
know what to do with him!

00:19:02.328 --> 00:19:03.022
Oh!

00:19:08.768 --> 00:19:11.134
What's up with that girl!

00:19:11.637 --> 00:19:14.105
She's keeping Teppa all to herself!

00:19:14.206 --> 00:19:16.538
She's old! I'm pissed!

00:19:16.709 --> 00:19:20.167
I love strong men like you, Teppa!

00:19:20.313 --> 00:19:23.749
Haven't you changed
your tune awfully fast?

00:19:23.849 --> 00:19:29.981
But you said you'd take care of me.
So for the rest of our lives...

00:19:30.156 --> 00:19:32.954
That was just a figure of speech.

00:19:33.092 --> 00:19:37.051
I want to be bound in
your armored cloth forever!

00:19:37.997 --> 00:19:40.830
I have a feeling
I'm the one who's bound!

00:19:40.933 --> 00:19:43.595
Then I'll bind you tighter!

00:19:43.836 --> 00:19:47.363
Rushuna, help me!

00:19:56.449 --> 00:19:59.612
Have your wounds healed completely?

00:20:00.886 --> 00:20:02.751
Yes, fully.

00:20:02.922 --> 00:20:04.913
So you will travel again?

00:20:05.024 --> 00:20:08.585
Yes, my journey to end the fighting
is not over yet.

00:20:10.696 --> 00:20:12.163
And you, Touka?

00:20:12.365 --> 00:20:18.600
I will expand Toukarou, to bring
more smiles to more people's faces.

00:20:19.071 --> 00:20:21.869
I believe that the two of you can do it.

00:20:21.974 --> 00:20:24.602
Even if it's only a little bit at a time.

00:20:24.710 --> 00:20:26.075
Certainly.

00:20:26.912 --> 00:20:30.609
It's become abundantly
clear to me. Rushuna...

00:20:30.716 --> 00:20:31.375
Yes?

00:20:31.484 --> 00:20:34.476
You are a Grenadier.

00:20:34.620 --> 00:20:35.609
That's...

00:20:38.758 --> 00:20:40.623
The Smiling Senshi.

00:20:41.927 --> 00:20:44.122
Thank you very much!

00:21:09.455 --> 00:21:11.446
The Smiling Senshi, huh?

00:21:11.657 --> 00:21:15.593
I would have thought Tenshi
would be at the top of that one.

00:21:16.595 --> 00:21:18.586
You think so too?

00:21:18.697 --> 00:21:22.098
Yeah, you have a long way to go.

00:21:22.201 --> 00:21:24.795
I know.

00:21:25.638 --> 00:21:28.266
But you're not bad.

00:21:28.474 --> 00:21:31.466
I'm not bad, but I'm happy!

00:21:31.644 --> 00:21:33.475
I'm not even close.

00:21:33.579 --> 00:21:34.341
Huh?

00:21:34.480 --> 00:21:37.313
I don't even have the "P" in power.

00:21:37.450 --> 00:21:39.475
I wonder...

00:21:39.985 --> 00:21:43.079
I think you got at least a "P".

00:21:43.289 --> 00:21:44.483
Yatchan!

00:21:52.965 --> 00:21:55.092
What are you doing?

00:21:55.201 --> 00:21:56.293
Mikan!

00:21:58.437 --> 00:22:00.405
Stop groping each other.

00:22:00.539 --> 00:22:02.507
I'm going with you.

00:22:03.075 --> 00:22:06.476
I'm not sure you two can handle it alone.

00:22:09.215 --> 00:22:11.410
Hey, wait for us!

00:22:13.319 --> 00:22:14.753
Would you like to join us?

00:22:14.753 --> 00:22:16.220
<i>I'll go with you!
Would you like to join us?</i>

00:22:16.422 --> 00:22:19.721
Let go of me, this is embarrassing!

00:22:19.925 --> 00:22:22.587
We have to strip Yajiro's armor too!

00:22:22.695 --> 00:22:25.391
I will strip it someday... your armor.

00:22:25.498 --> 00:22:27.625
Let's see you try!

00:22:28.367 --> 00:22:29.095
Okay!

00:22:43.482 --> 00:22:53.118
<i>All alone,
so many nights I want to cry.</i>

00:22:54.193 --> 00:23:03.864
<i>Everyone dreams on
the road of the endless journey.</i>

00:23:05.170 --> 00:23:10.403
<i>Always believe in something,
and always lose something.</i>

00:23:10.576 --> 00:23:14.637
<i>I hold you.</i>

00:23:15.714 --> 00:23:23.450
<i>All the tears I shed
will turn into kindness.</i>

00:23:23.789 --> 00:23:25.882
<i>I'm sure.</i>

00:23:26.158 --> 00:23:31.289
<i>Don't be defeated by sadness.</i>

00:23:31.497 --> 00:23:36.935
<i>Keep your eye on tomorrow.</i>

00:23:37.136 --> 00:23:47.137
<i>You're not alone.
Everyone has dreams to come true.</i>

00:23:47.479 --> 00:23:58.287
<i>The winds of tomorrow will
bring the fragrance of kindness.</i>

00:23:58.457 --> 00:24:09.061
<i>It's a promise...
I'll always be by your side.</i>
